OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOvercast
OL,6,Fwith rain across the region, heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes, through the evening. The rain
OL,8,Fturns lighter and patchier, away from
OL,9,Fthe Pennines overnight. Winds
OL,10,Fstrengthen and become blustery in
OL,11,Fplaces. Temperatures around average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FCloudy to start with patchy
OL,14,Flight rain, turning partly cloudy with
OL,15,Fshowers developing through the
OL,16,Fafternoon and into the evening.
OL,17,FBlustery winds with temperatures just
OL,18,Fabove average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
